OL,3,ATrump's comments on a united Ireland
OL,4,Amay have targeted audience across the
OL,5,AAtlantic
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen another world leader meets US
OL,8,FPresident Donald Trump the only
OL,9,Fcertainty about what might happen is
OL,10,Fthe uncertainty about what might
OL,11,Fhappen.
OL,13,FThis was exactly the case ahead of
OL,14,FPresident Trump's two-day visit to
OL,15,FIreland.
OL,17,FNobody could have predicted that by the
OL,18,Fend of the first day, the main global
OL,19,Fheadline would be his desire to see a
OL,20,Funified Ireland.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
